{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Classic 13-Tile Riichi Mahjong \u2013 Fast-Paced and Thrilling Matches\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for the top in ranked battles or just looking for some casual fun, Stardom Mahjong has you covered. Enjoy lightning-fast matchmaking\u2014get into a game within seconds\u2014and invite your friends to play together for a truly exciting mahjong experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/6f5c0b52657c47e284dc3d011dd08b38.poster.avif?t=1759211824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/6f5c0b52657c47e284dc3d011dd08b38.webm?t=1759211824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/6f5c0b52657c47e284dc3d011dd08b38.mp4?t=1759211824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Immersive Exploration: Showbiz Secrets \u00d7 R18 Forbidden Fantasies\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist (player) encounters an unexpected accident during a TV drama audition and, by a twist of fate, enters the entertainment industry disguised as a woman. From that moment, a completely different life unfolds. Soon after, the mysterious girl Kyoka rises to stardom with a drama hit, taking the showbiz world by storm and igniting an unprecedented frenzy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet behind the glamorous stage lies <strong>exclusive R18 adult content</strong>. Step into <i>Fantasies</i>, where you gradually unlock scenes of temptation and passion, and experience the most forbidden, most heated secrets of the entertainment world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/7ce40d9128126f29bcd33aa5e9e9dcf4.poster.avif?t=1759211824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/7ce40d9128126f29bcd33aa5e9e9dcf4.webm?t=1759211824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/7ce40d9128126f29bcd33aa5e9e9dcf4.mp4?t=1759211824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gorgeous Girls \u00d7 Famous Japanese Voice Actors\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sweet and innocent cuties to energetic girls and commanding big sisters, each heroine comes with her own unique charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stardom Mahjong, you'll bond with these dazzling beauties as you climb your way to the top of the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an all-star cast of renowned Japanese voice actors, the game delivers both visual and auditory delight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/b01836c96200fbe2134410c9056e2f89.poster.avif?t=1759211824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/b01836c96200fbe2134410c9056e2f89.webm?t=1759211824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/extras/b01836c96200fbe2134410c9056e2f89.mp4?t=1759211824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Variety of Modes to Explore\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong is just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the reels in the entertainment lounge\u2019s idol-themed slot machines, manage your own shop in free-roam mode, and discover countless unique gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of Stardom Mahjong now, and let your skills pave the way to stardom!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676110?t=1759211824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/9c18822611838afd07ee43c132ba533172fb8616/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759211824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/8d3694ecc2bde13efed95289540d70ea24c72e4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759211824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676110/8d3694ecc2bde13efed95289540d70ea24c72e4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759211824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is intended for adults (18+) and contains the following:\r\n\u2022 Explicit and frequent nudity\r\n\u2022 Explicit sexual dialogue and situations/plots\r\n\u2022 Oral, vaginal, anal, and non-penetrative sex\r\n\r\nAll characters appearing in this mature content are 18+."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Classic 13-Tile Riichi Mahjong \u2013 Fast-Paced and Thrilling Matches\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for the top in ranked battles or just looking for some casual fun, Stardom Mahjong has you covered. Enjoy lightning-fast matchmaking\u2014get into a game within seconds\u2014and invite your friends to play together for a truly exciting mahjong experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c